cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PhonAcq
message: "如果您在方言调查、语音实验或学术研究中使用了 PhonAcq，欢迎按以下元数据引用本软件。"
type: software
authors:
  - name: KasumiKitsune
    email: "screwyneko@gmail.com"
    website: "https://github.com/KasumiKitsune"
abstract: "PhonAcq 是一款面向汉语方言调查、民族语记音与实验语音学课堂训练的田野语音与方言字表采录系统，支持看图发音引导、局域网双设备无线联动、声学实时参考与 Praat / PhonTracer 规范导出。"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KasumiKitsune/PhonAcq"
url: "https://kasumikitsune.github.io/PhonAcq/"
version: "2.0.3"
date-released: "2026-11-25"
keywords:
  - phonetics
  - dialectology
  - linguistics
  - fieldwork
  - speech-acquisition
  - chinese-dialects
  - praat
